00:55:16.100 --> 00:55:18.540
Not by the party planning committee, by the way.
顺便说一下，这可不是派对策划委员会干的。

1248
00:55:18.700 --> 00:55:20.860
Angela would not allocate funds to this.
安吉拉才不会给这事拨经费呢。

1249
00:55:21.280 --> 00:55:22.720
But Dwight had this.
但德怀特有准备。

1250
00:55:22.860 --> 00:55:23.740
He had planned it.
他早就计划好了。

1251
00:55:23.780 --> 00:55:29.360
We had a fan question from Noel, Angela, because we're about to go to the ice skating rink now.
安吉拉，我们收到一个来自诺埃尔的粉丝提问，因为我们马上要去滑冰场了。

1252
00:55:29.360 --> 00:55:33.620
And that's the big surprise that he's taking us all ice skating.
这就是那个大惊喜，他要带我们所有人去滑冰。

1253
00:55:33.880 --> 00:55:38.380
And Noel wanted to know, did you have a safety meeting about ice skating?
诺埃尔想知道，你们当时有没有针对滑冰开过安全会议？

1254
00:55:38.860 --> 00:55:39.260
Remember?
还记得吗？

1255
00:55:39.540 --> 00:55:41.220
Safety meeting lit candle.
安全会议点燃了蜡烛。

1256
00:55:41.560 --> 00:55:42.720
I'm sure we did.
我肯定我们开过。

1257
00:55:42.940 --> 00:55:48.780
I'm sure there was a safety meeting about we have heavy things being held on the ice.
我敢肯定，关于我们在冰上拿着重物这件事，一定开过安全会议。

1258
00:55:48.780 --> 00:55:51.160
I'm sure there was all kinds of safety meetings.
我敢肯定当时开了各种各样的安全会议。

1259
00:55:51.440 --> 00:55:53.420
Well, I know we had a medic there.
嗯，我知道我们当时有医护人员在场。

1260
00:55:53.760 --> 00:55:59.680
And the reason that I know this is because, I don't know if you remember, Angela, but Mindy
我知道这个的原因是，安吉拉，我不知道你还记不记得，明迪

1261
00:55:59.680 --> 00:56:01.460
fell while we were shooting.
在拍摄时摔倒了。

1262
00:56:01.460 --> 00:56:02.480
I don't remember that.
我不记得了。

1263
00:56:02.480 --> 00:56:03.360
And she hurt her knee.
她伤到了膝盖。

1264
00:56:03.580 --> 00:56:07.460
So you know there's that little bit at the ice skating rink where Kelly is helping Ryan?
所以你知道在滑冰场那段凯利帮瑞安的戏吗？

1265
00:56:07.680 --> 00:56:07.880
Yeah.
记得。

1266
00:56:08.200 --> 00:56:09.400
Well, she fell.
其实她摔倒了。

1267
00:56:09.400 --> 00:56:10.480
And she hurt her knee.
她伤到了膝盖。

1268
00:56:10.520 --> 00:56:11.960
And the medic had to give her some ice.
医护人员不得不给她冰敷。

1269
00:56:11.960 --> 00:56:14.340
But she was able to finish filming.
但她还是坚持拍完了。

1270
00:56:14.540 --> 00:56:15.480
Her knee was okay.
她的膝盖没事。

1271
00:56:15.740 --> 00:56:18.640
I thought it was interesting when you saw the different couplings of
我觉得很有意思的是，你看到不同的人

1272
00:56:18.640 --> 00:56:19.520
people ice skating.
在滑冰时的配对。

1273
00:56:19.620 --> 00:56:21.140
In the beginning, you see Kelly and Ryan.
一开始，你看到凯利和瑞安。

1274
00:56:21.380 --> 00:56:23.400
You see Pam and Jim.
你看到帕姆和吉姆。

1275
00:56:23.960 --> 00:56:26.180
I sort of just kind of go around solo.
我基本上是独自滑来滑去。

1276
00:56:26.180 --> 00:56:27.060
So does Dwight.
德怀特也是。

1277
00:56:27.220 --> 00:56:30.280
We just kind of, we don't, you know, want anyone to know we're seeing each other.
我们只是，你知道的，不想让任何人知道我们在交往。

1278
00:56:30.360 --> 00:56:31.400
So we skate alone.
所以我们独自滑冰。

1279
00:56:31.700 --> 00:56:37.460
And then later, you see Ryan and Phyllis holding hands and ice skating.
后来，你看到瑞安和菲利斯手牵手滑冰。

1280
00:56:37.680 --> 00:56:39.540
Yes, at 19 minutes.
是的，在19分钟的时候。

1281
00:56:40.180 --> 00:56:43.440
We had a fan catch by KP who said,
我们收到一个来自KP的粉丝发现，他说：

1282
00:56:43.560 --> 00:56:47.840
I love when you see Ryan and Phyllis at the skating rink holding hands so Ryan won't fall.
我喜欢看到瑞安和菲利斯在滑冰场手牵手，这样瑞安就不会摔倒。

1283
00:56:47.840 --> 00:56:50.360
It's such a random glimpse into their friendship.
这真是他们友谊中一个随意的瞬间。

1284
00:56:50.640 --> 00:56:53.800
I think, Angela, they did that because Mindy was icing her knee.
安吉拉，我觉得他们那样做是因为明迪当时在给膝盖冰敷。

1285
00:56:54.000 --> 00:56:57.280
And what's really cute if you watch it is Phyllis is so tickled.
如果你仔细看，你会发现菲利斯特别开心。

1286
00:56:57.440 --> 00:56:58.580
She's so tickled.
她特别开心。

1287
00:56:58.640 --> 00:56:59.820
It's just really cute.
这真的很可爱。

1288
00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:01.220
It's very, very sweet.
非常、非常甜蜜。

1289
00:57:01.360 --> 00:57:04.980
And I actually, I went back after I read that comment and I watched it.
我读到那条评论后特意回去看了一下。

1290
00:57:05.060 --> 00:57:08.360
And it's really very sweet to see the two of them skating together.
看到他们俩一起滑冰真的很甜蜜。

1291
00:57:08.420 --> 00:57:10.460
So that was an accident.
所以那是个意外。

1292
00:57:10.460 --> 00:57:13.900
I had another fan question from Live Long, California.
我还有另一个来自加州Live Long的粉丝提问。

1293
00:57:14.200 --> 00:57:16.840
Did you and John know how to ice skate?
你和约翰会滑冰吗？

1294
00:57:17.320 --> 00:57:19.640
Or did you have to learn for this episode?
还是说你们为了这一集专门去学的？

1295
00:57:19.880 --> 00:57:21.540
So here's something interesting.
这里有个有趣的事实。

1296
00:57:21.820 --> 00:57:25.320
In this episode, Jim is kind of helping Pam on the ice.
在这一集中，吉姆在冰上帮了帕姆。

1297
00:57:25.820 --> 00:57:32.540
But right before we filmed this episode, I had actually been in some intense ice skating training
但在拍摄这一集之前，我其实刚接受过高强度的滑冰训练，

1298
00:57:32.540 --> 00:57:36.040
because I was filming a movie with Will Ferrell called Blades of Glory.
因为我当时正在和威尔·法瑞尔拍摄一部叫《冰刀双人组》的电影。

1299
00:57:37.280 --> 00:57:42.740
And yeah, every Saturday morning for a few months, I had to go early in the morning and
没错，有几个月的时间，每个周六早上我都得早起，

1300
00:57:42.740 --> 00:57:44.420
spend about three hours learning to ice skate.
花大约三个小时学习滑冰。

1301
00:57:44.540 --> 00:57:48.620
And the crazy thing is my character didn't even ice skate in the movie.
最疯狂的是，我的角色在电影里根本没滑过冰。

1302
00:57:48.820 --> 00:57:55.000
I am completely pretending to not know how to ice skate in this scene on The Office because
在《办公室》这场戏里，我完全是在假装自己不会滑冰，因为

1303
00:57:55.000 --> 00:58:00.640
I had actually just, I mean, kind of learned how to ice skate quite well thanks to this movie
多亏了那部电影的训练，我其实刚学会，

1304
00:58:00.640 --> 00:58:00.980
training.
我是说，滑得相当不错。

1305
00:58:00.980 --> 00:58:05.880
You're describing my fantasy, but all I ever wanted was to be cast in something where they're
你描述的正是我的幻想，我一直以来都希望被选进一个剧组，他们会

1306
00:58:05.880 --> 00:58:09.720
like, listen, Angela, you're going to have to learn Kung Fu.
对我说：听着，安吉拉，你得去学功夫。

1307
00:58:10.220 --> 00:58:12.140
You're going to go every Saturday.
你每个周六都要去。

1308
00:58:12.720 --> 00:58:17.840
You're going to become a Kung Fu master, or you're going to have to learn how to throw an axe.
你要成为一名功夫大师，或者你得去学怎么扔斧头。

1309
00:58:18.020 --> 00:58:20.300
You're going to get really good at throwing axes.
你要练就一身精湛的扔斧头技术。

1310
00:58:20.700 --> 00:58:25.660
Like I wanted to learn something like that, but it's never happened.
我一直想学点这种东西，但从来没机会。

1311
00:58:25.660 --> 00:58:31.400
Well, speaking of skating, Michael is zipping around in his hockey gear.
说到滑冰，迈克尔穿着他的冰球装备在场上飞驰。

1312
00:58:31.560 --> 00:58:36.200
So in the background of Michael's talking head, it's around 17 minutes, 42 seconds.
在迈克尔的单人访谈背景里，大约在17分42秒处。

1313
00:58:36.360 --> 00:58:42.040
There's a really great shot of that professional ice skater, Burt Lankin, who stands in for Oscar.
有一个非常棒的镜头，是奥斯卡的替身，专业花样滑冰运动员伯特·兰金。

1314
00:58:42.160 --> 00:58:43.320
He's doing a bunch of twirls.
他在那儿做了一连串的旋转动作。

1315
00:58:43.400 --> 00:58:44.340
It's just sort of fun.
看起来挺有意思的。

1316
00:58:45.220 --> 00:58:46.820
Nothing with you though, Ange.
不过没你什么事，安吉。

1317
00:58:47.080 --> 00:58:48.360
I know, nothing with me.
我知道，没我什么事。

1318
00:58:48.520 --> 00:58:52.060
But do you realize one of the office members who's not on the ice is Creed?
但你有没有注意到，办公室成员里有一个没在冰上的人是克里德？

1319
00:58:52.060 --> 00:58:56.720
And it's because he's in the arcade playing a shoot-em-up game with a bunch of kids.
那是因为他在游戏厅里跟一群孩子玩射击游戏呢。

1320
00:58:57.700 --> 00:58:59.100
Oh, yes, that's right.
哦，对，没错。

1321
00:58:59.460 --> 00:59:00.480
That's right.
确实如此。

1322
00:59:00.920 --> 00:59:04.640
Well, there's also that scene where Michael checks Toby into the wall.
对了，还有迈克尔把托比撞到墙上的那场戏。

1323
00:59:04.980 --> 00:59:05.340
Yeah.
是啊。

1324
00:59:05.720 --> 00:59:08.320
We had a fan question from Cardinals fan.
我们收到一个来自红雀队球迷的粉丝提问。

1325
00:59:08.580 --> 00:59:11.180
Was Toby harmed in the making of that scene?
托比在拍摄那场戏时受伤了吗？

1326
00:59:11.440 --> 00:59:11.880
No.
没有。

1327
00:59:12.180 --> 00:59:19.340
And if you watch closely, Steve's body never really touches Toby.
如果你仔细看，史蒂夫的身体其实根本没碰到托比。

1328
00:59:19.340 --> 00:59:27.220
Like, he really—like, Steve, I think because he's so good, he kind of slams into the wall
他真的——我觉得史蒂夫因为太厉害了，他只是撞向墙壁，

1329
00:59:27.220 --> 00:59:28.900
and makes a noise with his arMs.
然后用手臂制造出撞击声。

1330
00:59:28.980 --> 00:59:31.980
And then Paul just sort of falls to the ground himself.
接着保罗自己顺势倒在了地上。

1331
00:59:32.260 --> 00:59:33.980
No, Steve had total control.
不，史蒂夫完全掌控着力度。

1332
00:59:33.980 --> 00:59:35.960
But it's because he's such a good skater.
这正是因为他滑冰滑得太好了。

1333
00:59:35.960 --> 00:59:40.180
And so he could definitely sort of show off a little bit and do all that stuff.
所以他绝对能炫耀一下，做出那些动作。

1334
00:59:40.340 --> 00:59:44.480
Oh, this was for sure one of Steve's favorite film days, I think.
哦，我觉得这绝对是史蒂夫最喜欢的拍摄日之一。

1335
00:59:44.640 --> 00:59:45.300
It had to be.
肯定是。

1336
00:59:45.420 --> 00:59:46.160
It had to be.
必须是。

1337
00:59:46.160 --> 00:59:46.620
Yeah.
是啊。

1338
00:59:46.860 --> 00:59:48.060
He was having the best time.
他玩得特别开心。

1339
00:59:48.220 --> 00:59:48.380
Yeah.
是啊。

1340
00:59:48.560 --> 00:59:55.660
And also, he had the best time because Nancy Carell, his wife, in real life, shows up in
而且他玩得那么开心，还因为他现实生活中的妻子南希·卡瑞尔，

1341
00:59:55.660 --> 00:59:59.700
this episode again as Carol Stills, the real estate agent.
又在这一集里客串了房地产经纪人卡罗尔·斯蒂尔斯。

1342
01:00:00.060 --> 01:00:01.300
She's at the ice rink.
她当时也在溜冰场。

1343
01:00:01.540 --> 01:00:03.100
But Michael's so innocent.
但迈克尔太天真了。

1344
01:00:03.140 --> 01:00:05.460
He's like, oh, was this for sale?
他问：哦，这是待售房产吗？

1345
01:00:05.640 --> 01:00:06.880
And she's like, no, Michael.
她说：不，迈克尔。

1346
01:00:06.880 --> 01:00:11.900
Like, I can go places that aren't for sale, you know?
我是说，我可以去那些非待售的地方，你懂吗？

1347
01:00:12.080 --> 01:00:14.300
Like, my kids are here to ice skate.
我是带孩子来滑冰的。

1348
01:00:14.500 --> 01:00:16.780
And then he's so sweet with the kids.
然后他对孩子们特别贴心。

1349
01:00:16.780 --> 01:00:17.700
He's so sweet.
他真的太贴心了。

1350
01:00:17.840 --> 01:00:22.640
And we sort of learned that, like, Michael probably could have tried to play professional
我们从中了解到，迈克尔其实本可以尝试去打职业比赛的

1351
01:00:22.640 --> 01:00:26.820
hockey, but he didn't think it was a great job to have if you want a family.
冰球，但他觉得如果你想要组建家庭，那不是一份好工作。

1352
01:00:26.960 --> 01:00:28.000
And that's all he wants.
而那正是他想要的。

1353
01:00:28.140 --> 01:00:32.400
So it's just this theme, again, that Michael just wants a family.
所以这又回到了那个主题，迈克尔只是想要一个家庭。

1354
01:00:32.620 --> 01:00:33.800
That's what he wants.
那就是他想要的。

1355
01:00:33.800 --> 01:00:38.700
Well, you know, when he offers to pull the kids around the ice rink with his hockey stick,
嗯，你知道，当他提出用冰球杆拉着孩子们在溜冰场上转时，

1356
01:00:38.720 --> 01:00:41.240
he's skating backwards and he's pulling the kids.
他倒着滑冰，拉着孩子们。

1357
01:00:41.840 --> 01:00:44.120
Lee does that all the time with our kids.
李经常和我们的孩子这样做。

1358
01:00:44.340 --> 01:00:44.700
Aww.
噢。

1359
01:00:45.100 --> 01:00:49.860
So when I saw that, I was like, oh, I think that's like a hockey guy thing to do.
所以当我看到那一幕时，我就想，哦，我觉得那是打冰球的人会做的事。

1360
01:00:50.000 --> 01:00:54.140
You pull your kids around as they hold on to the hockey stick.
你拉着孩子们，让他们抓着冰球杆。

1361
01:00:54.340 --> 01:00:58.620
You just turned into, like, a 16-year-old girl with googly eyes.
你刚才简直就像个两眼放光的16岁小女生。

1362
01:00:58.680 --> 01:00:59.700
You just thought about your husband.
你刚才想到你丈夫了。

1363
01:01:00.040 --> 01:01:00.090
I know.
我知道。

1364
01:01:00.100 --> 01:01:01.900
I wish you could have seen Jenna just now.
真希望你能看到珍娜刚才的样子。

1365
01:01:01.900 --> 01:01:06.340
She just literally did this weird thing with her shoulder, and she kind of tossed her hair,
她刚才真的做了一个奇怪的耸肩动作，还甩了甩头发，

1366
01:01:06.380 --> 01:01:09.340
and she was like, I think it's a hockey guy thing.
然后她说，我觉得那是打冰球的人会做的事。

1367
01:01:09.920 --> 01:01:12.200
Like, it was, what just happened to you?
就像是，你刚才怎么了？

1368
01:01:13.480 --> 01:01:18.400
Clearly, when you saw your husband do that, you were like, yes, yes, baby.
很明显，当你看到你丈夫那样做时，你心里就在想，没错，没错，宝贝。

1369
01:01:19.480 --> 01:01:24.040
I get real smitten with him sometimes, especially when he does, you know.
我有时真的会被他迷住，尤其是当他做那些事的时候，你知道的。

1370
01:01:24.240 --> 01:01:25.180
When he's on the ice?
当他在冰上的时候？

1371
01:01:25.440 --> 01:01:25.760
Great fathering.
伟大的父爱。

1372
01:01:26.260 --> 01:01:26.480
Yeah.
是啊。

1373
01:01:26.480 --> 01:01:29.020
Yeah, on the ice being a great dad.
是啊，在冰上展现伟大的父爱。

1374
01:01:29.480 --> 01:01:33.060
Okay, now Kevin gets the phone call.
好了，现在凯文接到了电话。

1375
01:01:33.560 --> 01:01:35.000
Everyone skates around him.
所有人都围着他滑冰。

1376
01:01:35.120 --> 01:01:39.160
Jenna, I remember filming this because we had to time it out, and there were a bunch of us
珍娜，我记得拍摄这一幕，因为我们必须掌握好时间，我们有一群人

1377
01:01:39.160 --> 01:01:42.380
on the ice that skate up to where he is.
在冰上滑向他所在的位置。

1378
01:01:42.480 --> 01:01:43.400
Do you remember this?
你还记得吗？

1379
01:01:43.540 --> 01:01:45.900
Yes, and we have to all be able to stop.
记得，而且我们都得能停下来。

1380
01:01:46.240 --> 01:01:47.900
I didn't know how to stop.
我当时不知道怎么停下来。

1381
01:01:48.200 --> 01:01:48.460
Yeah.
是啊。

1382
01:01:48.720 --> 01:01:49.880
That was my one problem.
那是我的一个难题。

1383
01:01:49.880 --> 01:01:50.980
I didn't know how to stop.
我不知道怎么停下来。

1384
01:01:51.120 --> 01:01:56.880
So I remember trying to, like, push really hard to slow myself down so I didn't run into
所以我记得我当时试图用力蹬冰来减速，这样我就不会撞到

1385
01:01:56.880 --> 01:01:58.680
people, but I was, like, stressed out.
别人，但我当时压力很大。

1386
01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:01.140
Well, guess what?
嗯，你猜怎么着？

1387
01:02:01.440 --> 01:02:03.540
His results are negative.
他的检查结果是阴性。

1388
01:02:03.820 --> 01:02:05.400
Which is a good thing.
这是一件好事。

1389
01:02:05.640 --> 01:02:07.280
You want your results to be negative.
你当然希望检查结果是阴性。

1390
01:02:07.280 --> 01:02:08.740
But Michael doesn't understand that.
但迈克尔不明白这一点。

1391
01:02:08.820 --> 01:02:10.360
No, Michael's like, damn it.
不，迈克尔觉得，该死。

1392
01:02:10.360 --> 01:02:11.600
Michael is gutted.
迈克尔彻底崩溃了。

1393
01:02:11.720 --> 01:02:14.240
